{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/tianting1.gif?t=1744981356\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Wukong UP&quot; is a dark fantasy parkour game that supports multiplayer online play, supporting up to 4 people online. Sun Wukong made a big fuss in the Heavenly Palace and was later suppressed at the foot of Wuzhi Mountain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/up4.gif?t=1744981356\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The trapped Wukong used his remaining magic power to create a clone in an attempt to save himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/up6.gif?t=1744981356\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player is about to control the clone of Sun Wukong. The goal is to find and break Tathagata's seal and rescue the trapped Sun Wukong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/bone2.gif?t=1744981356\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players will sprint, jump and solve puzzles to reach the highest point to unlock Buddha's seal to save Wukong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/battle7.gif?t=1744981356\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the multiplayer online mode, players will be tied together and need to cooperate with other players to overcome levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/battle5.gif?t=1744981356\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now, come and invite your friends to rescue Wukong together!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2820450?t=1744981356","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744981356","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744981356","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744981356","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2945430,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Contact</h1><p><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/messageLogoEN.png?t=1744981356\" /><br>This game is in the public testing stage and we will actively listen to the opinions of players for improvement and refinement game.<br>If you like this game,please add wishlist!Thank you for your support.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/tianting1.gif?t=1744981356\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Wukong UP&quot; is a dark fantasy parkour game that supports multiplayer online play, supporting up to 4 people online. Sun Wukong made a big fuss in the Heavenly Palace and was later suppressed at the foot of Wuzhi Mountain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/up4.gif?t=1744981356\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The trapped Wukong used his remaining magic power to create a clone in an attempt to save himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/up6.gif?t=1744981356\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player is about to control the clone of Sun Wukong. The goal is to find and break Tathagata's seal and rescue the trapped Sun Wukong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/bone2.gif?t=1744981356\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players will sprint, jump and solve puzzles to reach the highest point to unlock Buddha's seal to save Wukong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/battle7.gif?t=1744981356\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the multiplayer online mode, players will be tied together and need to cooperate with other players to overcome levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/battle5.gif?t=1744981356\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now, come and invite your friends to rescue Wukong together!</p>","developers":["1ming\u76ca\u94ed"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/header.jpg?t=1744981356","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257127750,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127750/movie480.mp4?t=1744981353","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127750/movie_max.mp4?t=1744981353"},"name":"\u63a8\u7bb1\u5b50\u73a9\u6cd5\u5c55\u793a","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/25